<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1347_4667.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich nachpeurlich und
<lb n="2"/>guotwillig dienst zuvor. Fürsichtigen,
<lb n="3"/>ersamen, weisen, besonders lieben guoten
<lb n="4"/>freündte und nachpeuren.
<lb n="5"/>Wiewol wir auff eür jüngst, von wegen
<lb n="6"/>unsers gefangnen <persName resp="#ner">Gregorij Hartmans</persName>
<lb n="7"/>zuegeschikhten bericht, inne peinlichen
<lb n="8"/>und mit ernst befragen laßßen, haben
<lb n="9"/>wir doch bißhäro deßhalben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gründt</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekandtnus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> nit außbrinngen
<lb n="11"/>könden. Sonder nebendt dem er, auf
<lb n="12"/>beschehnen fürhalt, der entfüerten roßen
<lb n="13"/>halben, sein verantwortung mit vill
<lb n="14"/>umbstendten erzellt, zücht er auch
<lb n="15"/>diß füer. Das er gleichwol ett-
<lb n="16"/>liche zeit, von wegen kranckhs leibs bej
<lb n="17"/>eüch fenckhlich einkomen, und alß er
<lb n="18"/>dazmalen ongevahr ersehen das die thür
<lb n="19"/>offen stehendt, seÿe er aus der fanckhnus
<lb n="20"/>gangen, habe aber nachgendts sich
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freÿwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> eüch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einst</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stellt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sonderlich</unclear> aber zaigt
<lb n="23"/>er <persName resp="#ner">Hartman</persName> auch an, das ain seiler,
<lb n="24"/>mit namen <persName resp="#ner">Conradt Bertel</persName>, welcher
<lb n="25"/>vor der zeit unser burger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewesen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1347_4668.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißmalß</unclear> bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüerm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bürg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Leß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">For</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinger</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinsten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">falß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferben</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemacht</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbig</unclear> ainen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferber</unclear> zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-19" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bischzell</unclear></placeName> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rutgeri</unclear> Langen=
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ower</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genant</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelehrt</unclear> habe. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnmasen</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alberaitß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waren</unclear> von deßen=
<lb n="32"/>selben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maister</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geferbt</unclear> alhie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ains</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bürgern</unclear> befunden, und dieselben biß auff
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiteren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschaid</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handen</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>genomen.
<lb n="36"/>Und dieweil dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieran</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>sonder auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> und anderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernachpürten</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>sonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vil</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir nit
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zweiffel</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> deßhalben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> den
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gleichergestalten</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepür</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für=</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zünemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemaindt</unclear> sein. Und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelangt</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> hiemit unser fründtlich
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wollen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> deßhalben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüeren</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> und sonderlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollichermasen</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorermeltes</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sebaßtians</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferber</unclear> beschaffen
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> seiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verantwürttung</unclear> ange=
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">melten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezigeß</unclear> halben, bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darumben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgefertigten</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">potten</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erstem</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear>, zue <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lasen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1347_4669.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wofern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlangen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lebens</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferners</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unverhalten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><origDate when="1598" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">11.ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martii</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anno</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">98</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Verwalter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haubtmanschaft</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-56" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und Rath der
<lb n="56"/>statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costantz</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1347_4670.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="57"/>Den fuersichtigen, ersamen, weysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bur</unclear>-
<lb n="58"/>germaister und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rate</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Santt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="59"/>unseren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> fruend-
<lb n="60"/>en und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachpauren</unclear>.
</p>
